{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2018-03", "window": 3, "start_date": 1521158400, "end_date": 1521849599, "month_true_total": 1394, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:57:12 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "41003885", "author": {"steamid": "76561198402090193", "personaname": "Rage", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198402090193/", "num_games_owned": 7, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1432, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 948, "last_played": 1560925907, "avatar": "844d6d99a6d9d2318f9ac7472d7a60a3d90e73a3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fabulous", "timestamp_created": 1521848288, "timestamp_updated": 1521848288, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41003707", "author": {"steamid": "76561198388170413", "personaname": "Ares", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/55667876565/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 293, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19, "last_played": 1683405838, "avatar": "5c257a792a535639af6918516ea5f75ae6323bc9"}, "language": "english", "review": "hi", "timestamp_created": 1521847503, "timestamp_updated": 1521847503, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41003463", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046934784", "personaname": "Bazza", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198046934784/", "num_games_owned": 677, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 152934, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 75277, "last_played": 1762859382, "avatar": "060e457aadfc1d1322b4a9c158f050f1abd4cced"}, "language": "english", "review": "As a founder and longtime player with all frames currently in the game I've come to love and hate this game and whilst Warframe is in general a great game to play with friends its got a lot of flaws you will discover the further you get into it. \n\nIts grind is tedious and often unrewarding as most weapons in the game have become useless due to power creep and are just used to farm mastery and are then discarded most end game players use the exact same setup on every warframe. \n\nSeveral warframes in the game are just not particularly useful or have alternatives that fulfill the same job much better. It's complete lack of rewarding endgame content leaves you feeling lackadaisical towards playing the game getting good is punishing in this game as it just causes you to realise how vapid the gameplay is.  \n\nSeveral mission types are not fun at all, mainly consistant of a large waits filled with easy to kill enemies and tabbing out to do something more fun only to have to redo that very same mission because you didn't get the item you need.\n\nComing into this game as a new player you can have a lot of fun and I treasure the good times I've had with this game but It doesn't take away from my overall dissapointment at the game has progressed over the past year and how little fun remains to be had for end game players.", "timestamp_created": 1521846434, "timestamp_updated": 1521846434, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.473417729139328003", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "41003365", "author": {"steamid": "76561198371088837", "personaname": "Legmaer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Legmaer/", "num_games_owned": 113, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1369, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 876, "last_played": 1721168980, "avatar": "26ee95fe4b6c5f41a27ea16b6415580efcc74e2f"}, "language": "english", "review": "very good game", "timestamp_created": 1521846025, "timestamp_updated": 1521846025, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41003334", "author": {"steamid": "76561198320810650", "personaname": "bird", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Drugernaughty/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 136409, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 9, "playtime_at_review": 122433, "last_played": 1788901387, "avatar": "57854173478ddaa37547f9ab489ef5ed65e55d5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "More than half of my playtime is doing nothing but customizing.", "timestamp_created": 1521845894, "timestamp_updated": 1765896883, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}